{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/ebd46952c00909a702c714ecf04becc3.avif?t=1760480687\" width=617 height=171 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/4e1104eefd981b5165fb0bed83d1a455.poster.avif?t=1760480687\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/4e1104eefd981b5165fb0bed83d1a455.webm?t=1760480687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/4e1104eefd981b5165fb0bed83d1a455.mp4?t=1760480687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/cf2717fc97dcc30a66c1edd3216ebee3.webp?t=1760480687\" width=615 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Baiacool \u2013 Tides of Olympus</strong> puts you in the skin (okay, scales) of a <strong>pufferfish</strong> on a quest to find Poseidon after receiving a cryptic message. Explore Greek god temples, solve puzzles, and fight enemies using a <strong>mystical stick</strong> (<span class=\"bb_strike\">he <i>insists</i> on being called that</span>) who just won\u2019t shut up. Uncover who's behind all of this \u2013 by saying just one word\u2026 <strong>cool</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/ce3e9a2c0acc5986b5ba70b23b8ebef1.poster.avif?t=1760480687\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/ce3e9a2c0acc5986b5ba70b23b8ebef1.webm?t=1760480687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/ce3e9a2c0acc5986b5ba70b23b8ebef1.mp4?t=1760480687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/cf2717fc97dcc30a66c1edd3216ebee3.webp?t=1760480687\" width=615 height=48 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A marine adventure (that doesn\u2019t feel like a water level) where the entire Greek pantheon ended up under the sea.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles that would make even Daedalus lose his cool.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet famous mythological characters (if Achilles were a fish, where would his heel be???)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the underwater folks with their problems (always for a good reason, of course: epic rewards that probably do something cool... I think).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a bunch of outfits, weapons, and powers to prove Hecate\u2019s not the only one pulling magical sea bunnies out of a hat.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the depths of Greek mythology\u00a0 and don\u2019t just float around clueless.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/512d095c3331abc1c0673395c6c1c67f.poster.avif?t=1760480687\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/512d095c3331abc1c0673395c6c1c67f.webm?t=1760480687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/512d095c3331abc1c0673395c6c1c67f.mp4?t=1760480687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/cf2717fc97dcc30a66c1edd3216ebee3.webp?t=1760480687\" width=615 height=48 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3797250?t=1760480687","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/d2b331f6a3ba2cab0747581f8fd696ff87f73f37/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760480687","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/db9125cb4d2be28e295c7b1ce9fd5c584f8abbcf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760480687","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/db9125cb4d2be28e295c7b1ce9fd5c584f8abbcf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760480687","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/ebd46952c00909a702c714ecf04becc3.avif?t=1760480687\" width=617 height=171 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/4e1104eefd981b5165fb0bed83d1a455.poster.avif?t=1760480687\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/4e1104eefd981b5165fb0bed83d1a455.webm?t=1760480687\" type=\"video/webm