vel) where the entire Greek pantheon ended up under the sea.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles that would make even Daedalus lose his cool.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet famous mythological characters (if Achilles were a fish, where would his heel be???)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the underwater folks with their problems (always for a good reason, of course: epic rewards that probably do something cool... I think).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a bunch of outfits, weapons, and powers to prove Hecate\u2019s not the only one pulling magical sea bunnies out of a hat.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the depths of Greek mythology\u00a0 and don\u2019t just float around clueless.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/512d095c3331abc1c0673395c6c1c67f.poster.avif?t=1760480687\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/512d095c3331abc1c0673395c6c1c67f.webm?t=1760480687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/512d095c3331abc1c0673395c6c1c67f.mp4?t=1760480687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/cf2717fc97dcc30a66c1edd3216ebee3.webp?t=1760480687\" width=615 height=48 /></span></p>","developers":["Sassquatch with socks"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/6399bafa642ef5b07